The physics course entries follow the Cavendish Laboratory's 2025–26 teaching list.https://www.phy.cam.ac.uk/study/undergraduate/undergraduate-courses/[Undergraduate Courses: course list and academic-year notice]{ref}

Past examination papers: https://www-teach.phy.cam.ac.uk/dms/dmsSearch.php?type=examPapers[Physics Teaching Information System past-paper search] (University sign-in required). Specific paper years and their solution availability must be checked inside the system.

A public release includes physics papers for 2017–2019 and 2021–2022, with examiner reports and some answers. https://www.whatdotheyknow.com/request/natural_science_tripos_physics_e[Cambridge freedom-of-information response, 20 September 2022]{ref}

