= Particle Physics course of the University of Cambridge
{parent=Physics course of the year 4 of the natural sciences course of the University of Cambridge}
{c}
{title2=Major topic}

= Past exam of the particle physics course of the University of Cambridge
{parent=Particle Physics course of the University of Cambridge}

Past papers, worked solutions and errata: https://www.hep.phy.cam.ac.uk/~lester/teaching/partIIIparticles/exams/index.html

The archive lists papers for 2000–2025. Worked solutions are public for 2000–2008, 2012–2018 and 2020–2025; skip those years for new solutions. The archive does not provide solutions for 2009–2011 and marks the 2019 solutions as not released publicly.

2025 paper: https://www.hep.phy.cam.ac.uk/~lester/teaching/partIIIparticles/exams/PartIIIParticles_202425.pdf

2025 worked solutions: https://www.hep.phy.cam.ac.uk/~lester/teaching/partIIIparticles/exams/PartIIIParticles_202425_with_answers.pdf

